Subject: [PATCH] build(chronik): register V2 branch query module

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Register the V2 branch query module in the Chronik indexer query namespace. This exposes the new kernel to crate compilation without adding runtime routes or enabling V2 indexing.

---
 chronik/chronik-indexer/src/query/mod.rs | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chronik/chronik-indexer/src/query/mod.rs b/chronik/chronik-indexer/src/query/mod.rs
index 685013f691aa8b85613002de37a828f1c6d580af..4a2b635c0f156e9f0ed4c7bb837e5a93f352e3cd 100644
--- a/chronik/chronik-indexer/src/query/mod.rs
+++ b/chronik/chronik-indexer/src/query/mod.rs
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@ mod plugins;
 mod tx_token_data;
 mod txs;
 mod util;
+pub mod v2_branches;
 
 pub use self::blocks::*;
 pub use self::broadcast::*;
